# One frontend, many targets

Workbooks runs on desktop, in the browser, and on mobile. There is no separate
desktop app, web app, and mobile app — there is **one** frontend that talks to a
single capability surface. A *target* is just a choice of how that surface is
fulfilled. No code fork per platform.

